# Vendored Haskell sources are only for the nix-less docker build
# (docker/Dockerfile*). The IHP flake module enumerates every *.hs in the
# project as an app module, so the top-level vendor/ must stay out of the
# nix source. Anchored: a bare "vendor" pattern also strips static/vendor/
# (fonts, bootstrap, jquery) from the nix-built image's static package.
# Tracked files stay tracked; new vendor content needs `git add -f`.
/vendor
del
static/prod.*
Config/client_session_key.aes

# Ignore locally checked out IHP version
IHP

# devenv.sh
.devenv*
devenv.local.nix
.direnv
__pycache__/

